WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
CHOWK simulates mixed, lane-free traffic on a five-junction Indian arterial.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:11.600
The divider compares two controllers on identical demand and the same seed.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:18.800
The camera rides with a two-wheeler as it filters through gaps.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
At a junction, the speed overlay shows who moves beside stopped queues.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:33.200
The pressure overlay shows how much of each approach is occupied.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.800
CHOWK minimises delay to people, so a full bus counts for more than a car.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:49.500
Both simulations receive an ambulance at the same tick.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:58.500
A demand surge tests how the controllers respond to a busier approach.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:04.900
Place a stalled bus to close part of the same road on both sides.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Results reports the held-out benchmark. The browser rerun is edited for time.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:22.000
Each rerun checks the state hash and metrics against the published result.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.000
The checkpoint slider runs the actual baseline and learned weights.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.000
All results are simulation results.
